<title>FRANCE: Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</title>
<headline>Highlights of ONIC maize estimates.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>French cereals office ONIC issued the following monthly maize estimates (million tonnes). Revisions for 1995/96 are marked*. 96/97 (Aug/Sept)    95/96 (Aug/Sept)</p>
<p> Opening stocks		   1.653	     * 1.671</p>
<p> Harvested crop		  13.600		12.394</p>
<p> Use on farms		     1.900	     * 1.958</p>
<p> Other domestic use	     3.202	     * 3.057</p>
<p>   - incl. animal feed	  2.050	     * 1.909</p>
<p> Exports to EU		    5.570	     * 6.087</p>
<p> Non-EU commercial exports   0.400-1.400	* 0.164</p>
<p> Final stocks		    1.981-2.981	* 1.653</p>
</text>
